    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>This game is still in early development. Please wishlist and follow the page for updates as the game progresses!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wykke is a dark fantasy game about a witch exploring the depths of her powers against angelic beings in the void between worlds. The combat style moves at a deliberate and tactical pace akin to soulslike games, but  has a roguelite progression with arena style wave combat, artifacts to level up each weapon, and permanent upgrades after each defeat. Master the use of various wands, each with a unique combat style, and become the most powerful occultists of all time.</p>",
